Tonight's rosters from the NHL Media Site.

Pavel Mintyukov and Jeff Malott are out. Nick Jensen and Nikita Klepov are in. Judd Caulfield is still back in SoCal (birth of child).

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

Judd Caulfield (birth of child), Nikita Klepov (scratch) and Nick Jensen (scratch) come out of the Ducks line-up on Long Island.

Nikita Nesterenko, Sam Colangelo and Drew Helleson draw back into the Anaheim line-up.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

Mikael Granlund (upper body, day to day) is on the ice at Ducks practice in a regular jersey.

Joel Quenneville said yesterday that he’ll be on the four-game road trip and is expected to play.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether
